msgid "POSIX.1-2001."
msgstr "POSIX.1-2001."

#.  glibc commit 3cdaa6adb113a088fdfb87aa6d7747557eccc58d
#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Before glibc 2.13, B<statvfs>()  populated the bits of the I<f_flag> field "
"by scanning the mount options shown in I</proc/mounts>.  However, starting "
"with Linux 2.6.36, the underlying B<statfs>(2)  system call provides the "
"necessary information via the I<f_flags> field, and since glibc 2.13, the "
"B<statvfs>()  function will use information from that field rather than "
"scanning I</proc/mounts>."
msgstr ""
"Avant la glibc 2.13, B<statvfs>() remplissait les bits du champ I<f_flag> en "
"balayant les options de montage apparaissant dans I</proc/mounts>. "
"Toutefois, à partir de Linux 2.6.36, l'appel système B<statfs>(2) sous-"
"jacent fournit les informations nécessaires dans le champ I<f_flags> et "
"depuis la glibc 2.13, la fonction utilise les informations provenant de ce "
"champ plutôt que de balayer I</proc/mounts>."

